#> source: y/aeiou/AEIOU/
# 10. y. Sheet: "y/source/dest/" transliterates characters in source to the corresponding
# character in dest. No regex: every a becomes A, every e becomes E, one for one, all
# at once, on every line. The two lists must be the same length. It is tr inside sed.
# Try: y/0123456789/##########/ hides the numbers; y/ae/x/ is an error (unequal lengths).
y/aeiou/AEIOU/

